Title: The Last Cue
Credit: Original fictional rehearsal, matching Scenic
Author: Fictional demo content
Notes: Maya (22) and Leo (23) are fictional adults.

INT. BLACK-BOX THEATRE - EVENING #1#

A desk, chair, prop notebook and practical lamp wait on the rehearsal floor. Maya, the stage manager, sets the notebook beside the lamp. Leo, the lighting operator, checks the cue list.


MAYA
From the top. Desk set, notebook ready. Stand by cue twelve.


LEO
Standing by.

Maya crosses to the chair. The lamp comes on, but the stage wash stays dark.


MAYA
Hold. We missed the wash before the practical.


LEO
I followed thirteen. My mistake. Reset twelve?


MAYA
Reset. We have time to get it right.

Leo returns to his mark. Maya replaces the notebook and clears the chair.


MAYA
Stand by twelve. Go.

The wash rises. The practical glows. Maya sits and opens the notebook.


LEO
Cue complete.


MAYA
And rehearsal complete.
